<description>&lt;p&gt;A school roof collapsed in Peshawar, killing dozens of children and a teacher, prompting families to demand justice and prompting authorities to order school inspections. The Pakistani government has imposed emergency rule in Khyber Pakhtunkhwa amid rising tension, while the Taliban and Russia are drawing closer, heightening regional strain. An emergency border response is underway in Afghanistan, as detailed in a ReliefWeb report covering late September to early October 2026. The conflict in the region produced 1,794 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiyAFBVV95cUxQTFJsaXVKVzVwVzRwRFZEVWFvQmlzM3JGaEUzaWozQVdzRUZPS0N4LXVaRmphUXI0em53Qmk3aTc4R3BzQUFQOTlFbE5SdmVCSXN3eVJNM0Rfc0NZenhPWkR1M3IxNEFHOTJXMmI5ejlLWUlsZU1abWgyUWk4QVdLSXBjTE5iOVVFY3cwSkpyR2laWmxIenFfV0d3LWFRUTRSVkw5WTN2NmphVnhDcGdsU2NqX0pLUmRmOXR4dDlhQW1jYzdvbzdqWg?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikwFBVV95cUxPem9jVHJuR1I5X3JBemw2cTVXYVF3aFhqRUp3UmtGN21lbGNRVE5XSGhSaG1ZZWw1dmhGMW1vSWVnNXVHMml1SWJrODhxR0ktRGl2UDJPakwteTJaR0d5MkxXQkxYNXh5ZzlRM3F2Y3hKdnE4MlpwMTl5Sm9CVC10T1VxZVQxcl82RU8xajU5UWpBRVk?oc=5&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiSEFVX3lxTFBzWXRZSW1idU8zWTVDSWQ5Y2ZiRnRIWHAxZkZPODRjOFY3NzhSWllYb3hTT21aY0lwU0ZYLXRRTlUzNTdwM0htQw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Dawn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivAFBVV95cUxNaEtBaXJFVS1NUG1xMktzMG5wNGF6VF96VGVCT1p5Vk5wMzJXUmUwd3RjWnB2ODBxc0czNGxObk5WQm1qM1haOFU1OG9pMlBVZy1YMElnUk94RXBBdnhlOFVEVUNSUmdONTA2c1FleTNxZkhGMl9IOGRlbWhhakYzc09zZ2VZTGgtSFJUVm1kZjYyUjJjWXI4STlYVTFkZXpwZlcwQ2JRSVUzblNDS0R4bEhDdVZqbFV0QXYxNQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Euronews.co